WEBVTT

00:16.474 --> 00:20.311
Arctis Obscura Forta Magnificat!

00:29.487 --> 00:31.239
<i>I did it!</i>

00:36.077 --> 00:38.371
Worried about what's happening down there?

00:39.080 --> 00:41.123
Somewhat, yes.

00:41.124 --> 00:45.377
Look, Guitane,
why don't we stop here and...

00:45.378 --> 00:47.130
It seems I've lost...

00:47.505 --> 00:49.132
...some of my pieces.

00:52.218 --> 00:53.887
Ten Commandments.

01:02.604 --> 01:03.730
What's that?!

01:04.564 --> 01:08.234
Even if I don't help the battle
on the surface, the result is the same.

01:11.237 --> 01:12.906
Something fell down...

01:15.617 --> 01:16.909
Come on...

01:16.910 --> 01:18.411
Enough already...

01:18.953 --> 01:24.459
I have sent ten parts
of myself down below.

01:27.754 --> 01:31.800
Each is comparable to an S-rank chimera.

01:35.887 --> 01:41.684
I only needed myself
to destroy this kingdom.

01:52.904 --> 01:57.659
(I Was Reincarnated as the 7th Prince so I Can Take
My Time Perfecting My Magical Ability 2nd Season)

03:15.320 --> 03:18.114
<i>I've memorized the mana signature
of those eggs.</i>

03:18.364 --> 03:20.241
<i>I'll wipe them out with Shadow Wolf.</i>

03:20.950 --> 03:22.743
I won't let you.

03:22.744 --> 03:28.248
I know you can use your teleportation
spell as an offense,

03:28.249 --> 03:31.001
but it requires you to really focus.

03:31.002 --> 03:35.505
Not to mention, it's difficult to
perform it on a moving target, yes?

03:35.506 --> 03:37.884
You will not interfere.

03:39.260 --> 03:40.553
Galilea!

03:41.054 --> 03:44.849
Until this kingdom lies in ruin,

03:45.767 --> 03:48.519
my surrogates will never stop.

03:51.898 --> 03:54.066
What are these things?!

03:54.067 --> 03:56.151
Talia, run...

03:56.152 --> 04:01.032
That chimera is nothing like the others!

04:03.284 --> 04:04.493
Open the door!

04:04.494 --> 04:06.036
Let us go outside!

04:06.037 --> 04:08.997
Wait, you can't go outside!
It's full of chimeras out there!

04:08.998 --> 04:11.917
You idiot! It's just as bad in here!

04:11.918 --> 04:14.754
Are we supposed to wait
and be eaten by that thing?!

04:18.049 --> 04:19.091
You guys!

04:19.092 --> 04:21.885
Hurry up and run, Katarina!

04:21.886 --> 04:24.346
We'll stop them here!

04:24.347 --> 04:27.016
But... You can't...

04:27.684 --> 04:32.229
Everyone... is already on their limit...

04:32.230 --> 04:34.356
Where's the Pope?!

04:34.357 --> 04:36.943
Where is God?!

04:37.819 --> 04:43.908
I did believe for many years
that they do exist, at the very least.

04:46.995 --> 04:49.121
Well, what do you think?

04:49.122 --> 04:54.127
Are you something that is worthy
to be called God?

04:57.547 --> 05:00.215
I said...!

05:00.216 --> 05:01.383
Well...

05:01.384 --> 05:04.971
I believe the results
speak for themselves.

05:09.267 --> 05:10.393
Why...

05:11.102 --> 05:15.022
We fought so far,
and now there's something stronger?!

05:15.023 --> 05:17.900
You couldn't protect anything.

05:18.651 --> 05:23.113
Wait, something's wrong! There are
huge bodies of mana all over the surface!

05:23.114 --> 05:24.157
What?!

05:26.743 --> 05:29.037
This kingdom will fall.

05:33.333 --> 05:37.170
I'm sorry I couldn't be of help.

05:38.171 --> 05:40.590
I would like to add one thing.

05:41.049 --> 05:43.800
My intention is not
to massacre the people.

05:43.801 --> 05:49.057
What I wish to destroy is this kingdom
and its mistaken belief.

05:51.142 --> 05:55.938
That its foundation was not built
on the existence of God.

05:56.439 --> 05:58.691
To make people realize that...

05:59.650 --> 06:01.194
It would require...

06:02.862 --> 06:05.198
A small sacrifice.

07:08.344 --> 07:10.137
<i>Boundless Innocence.</i>

07:10.138 --> 07:14.892
<i>It was the only Luxa
that Escher was able to use.</i>

07:15.685 --> 07:17.770
<i>It is unable to cause any harm.</i>

07:18.479 --> 07:20.523
<i>Its effect is to amplify sound.</i>

07:21.441 --> 07:24.360
<i>Its only purpose was
to carry her voice far and wide.</i>

07:26.154 --> 07:28.448
<i>It may only be a song,
but Escher's voice...</i>

07:29.574 --> 07:32.034
<i>It cleared away people's confusion.</i>

07:33.035 --> 07:34.537
<i>It gave them courage.</i>

07:35.538 --> 07:39.292
<i>Even the supposedly
heartless chimeras were affected.</i>

07:40.334 --> 07:42.044
<i>For just a brief moment...</i>

07:47.550 --> 07:48.676
<i>Everything stopped.</i>

07:50.678 --> 07:52.096
<i>Except for one man.</i>

07:52.680 --> 07:55.099
<i>Except for Me!</i>

07:56.642 --> 07:59.395
Shadow Wolf - Slash!

08:03.399 --> 08:07.028
Whatever happened
to make you cause all this...

08:08.154 --> 08:11.908
Whatever weird ideas you have about me...

08:12.700 --> 08:15.912
I really don't care about them at all.

08:16.579 --> 08:19.665
The only thing I'm interested in
is your magic.

08:20.583 --> 08:25.171
I'll play along as much as you want
if it means I get to take you home.

08:27.965 --> 08:29.592
Don't you worry.

08:30.134 --> 08:34.430
The abyss of sorcery is beyond your grasp.

08:36.057 --> 08:37.141
Come on.

08:39.101 --> 08:41.103
Time for the final round.

08:44.524 --> 08:47.108
(I Was Reincarnated as the 7th Prince so I Can Take
My Time Perfecting My Magical Ability 2nd Season)

08:47.109 --> 08:49.986
What?! We're heading somewhere else?!

08:49.987 --> 08:51.739
Things changed.

08:52.240 --> 08:55.868
This might be just my gut feeling,
but this song could be trouble.

08:56.744 --> 09:00.622
<i>The chimeras were decapitated at
almost the same time as the song started.</i>

09:00.623 --> 09:02.500
<i>Is this God's doing?</i>

09:03.000 --> 09:05.877
<i>In any case, I cannot let it be.</i>

09:05.878 --> 09:08.171
This is our colleagues' fault.

09:08.172 --> 09:12.092
I can't rest until all of these
damned chimeras are dead.

09:12.093 --> 09:14.387
<i>This bishop is scary...</i>

09:16.639 --> 09:17.890
Bishop Dante! Watch out!

09:22.186 --> 09:24.813
Huh, so it can still move.

09:24.814 --> 09:25.898
Right...

09:28.818 --> 09:31.653
I'm heading to the source of this song.

09:31.654 --> 09:33.655
You should stay here.

09:33.656 --> 09:36.157
Wait, I'm coming too!

09:36.158 --> 09:38.911
This song has to be Escher's song.

09:40.079 --> 09:42.914
<i>After telling him that
the Pope is the culprit,</i>

09:42.915 --> 09:47.086
<i>he's been fighting the chimeras
along the way as if he were possessed.</i>

09:47.670 --> 09:53.551
<i>I couldn't help at all because Dante
finished everything by himself.</i>

09:54.093 --> 09:58.055
You've been working hard
by healing the townspeople.

09:58.806 --> 10:02.517
You're far more useful
than the idiot you're carrying.

10:02.518 --> 10:05.186
You're suited to work for the church.

10:05.187 --> 10:07.981
I'm not...

10:07.982 --> 10:10.901
I prefer those with a bit of guilt.

10:15.156 --> 10:19.327
Having a bit of darkness in them
is what makes us human.

10:26.959 --> 10:28.461
<i>That's right...</i>

10:29.587 --> 10:31.922
<i>I should've noticed back then.</i>

10:32.965 --> 10:37.219
<i>Boss, I will stop you.</i>

10:39.889 --> 10:44.352
Back then, I had a happy life.

10:47.063 --> 10:49.397
Dad, sing us a song!

10:49.398 --> 10:51.608
Sure! I'm tone deaf, though!

10:51.609 --> 10:56.029
<i>I didn't have much money,
but I have a loving family.</i>

10:56.030 --> 11:00.368
<i>They accepted me
without a single complaint.</i>

11:01.410 --> 11:03.370
I love Dad's singing!

11:03.371 --> 11:06.123
He gets lost so easily, as well.

11:06.957 --> 11:10.126
<i>I loved them more than anything.</i>

11:10.127 --> 11:12.003
He's out of tune.

11:12.004 --> 11:13.797
But that's nice
in its own way.

11:13.798 --> 11:16.257
<i>To repay the joy I gained,</i>

11:16.258 --> 11:22.556
<i>I healed people using Divine Sorcery
at the church every day.</i>

11:23.474 --> 11:26.601
You, Guitane, was it?

11:26.602 --> 11:29.563
That voice...
Are you, Angel Jihriel?!

11:30.523 --> 11:33.651
<i>Even an angel recognized my efforts.</i>

11:34.193 --> 11:37.737
I've listened to your song every day
and I can't take it anymore.

11:37.738 --> 11:39.280
You suck.

11:39.281 --> 11:41.783
I-I'm sorry, but...

11:41.784 --> 11:45.954
I know that a lot of people count on you.

11:45.955 --> 11:48.415
You don't have to sing anymore.

11:48.416 --> 11:52.336
From now on,
you can use Divine Sorcery freely.

11:54.171 --> 11:56.089
You get a special permission.

11:56.090 --> 11:58.383
Consider yourself lucky.

11:58.384 --> 12:00.219
Thank you very much!

12:00.761 --> 12:05.348
<i>When I became a bishop,
I was constantly faced with challenges.</i>

12:05.349 --> 12:08.226
Come on, use that cleansing spell on me.

12:08.227 --> 12:10.604
Doubt I'll change, though.

12:11.105 --> 12:13.607
<i>These kind of people pisses me off,</i>

12:16.861 --> 12:19.362
<i>so I just beat them up using Luxa.</i>

12:19.363 --> 12:21.531
Why won't you cleanse me?

12:21.532 --> 12:27.495
Because I can see you're trying
to run away from your darkness with it.

12:27.496 --> 12:29.290
Even without that spell,

12:30.249 --> 12:35.212
I know you can defeat
the darkness in your heart.

12:37.506 --> 12:40.967
I did my hair so it looks
just like yours, Boss!

12:40.968 --> 12:44.263
Please don't call me that, Dante.

12:45.181 --> 12:50.268
<i>He became my first ally and follower.</i>

12:50.269 --> 12:52.687
Like I said!

12:52.688 --> 12:57.484
There won't be any more poverty
once I become king!

12:57.485 --> 12:59.861
Then hurry up and become one!

12:59.862 --> 13:04.532
There are still people suffering
on the outskirts of Saloum!

13:04.533 --> 13:08.536
<i>Sometimes I clashed with the royal family.</i>

13:08.537 --> 13:12.457
Then you should become the Pope as well.
Then I'll call it fair!

13:12.458 --> 13:15.543
<i>I had nothing to fear.</i>

13:15.544 --> 13:19.547
Indeed, let us seek greater heights
for the sake of the kingdom.

13:19.548 --> 13:23.802
<i>Because my soul
stayed steadfast in my belief.</i>

13:24.970 --> 13:26.639
<i>At least, until that day.</i>

13:27.806 --> 13:32.936
<i>On my way home, I found a thin, starving
girl sitting in front of my house.</i>

13:32.937 --> 13:37.066
<i>I could tell that she came from
one of the impoverished communities.</i>

13:37.566 --> 13:43.988
<i>I immediately invited her into my home
to dine with my wife's cooking.</i>

13:43.989 --> 13:47.076
<i>I believed she would be
a good friend with my son.</i>

13:48.577 --> 13:53.790
<i>The girl who called herself Anastasia
said something strange.</i>

13:53.791 --> 13:56.961
Father told me to keep watch outside.

13:59.588 --> 14:04.426
<i>It only took a moment for me
to understand what she meant.</i>

14:05.386 --> 14:09.515
<i>My family was submerged
in a sea of blood.</i>

14:13.310 --> 14:16.563
<i>Beyond the lifeless bodies
of my wife and son</i>

14:16.564 --> 14:20.317
<i>is a man gorging himself
on our food with no end.</i>

14:21.235 --> 14:23.403
<i>"Who is this scum...?"</i>

14:23.404 --> 14:26.656
<i>"Why didn't God protect my family...?"</i>

14:26.657 --> 14:29.869
<i>"What was I serving God for?"</i>

14:30.828 --> 14:33.997
<i>When the swirling rage in my head
conjured those words,</i>

14:33.998 --> 14:36.375
<i>I fell into an even deeper despair.</i>

14:36.876 --> 14:42.131
<i>"Was I serving God all this time because
I was expecting something in return?"</i>

14:49.638 --> 14:54.059
<i>I finally steeled myself to cleanse him
with Divine Sorcery.</i>

14:55.269 --> 14:58.605
<i>I don't know how he will repent,</i>

14:58.606 --> 15:02.026
<i>or whether I'm able to
forgive him at all...</i>

15:02.568 --> 15:07.530
<i>But those concerns vanished in an instant.</i>

15:07.531 --> 15:08.781
What?

15:08.782 --> 15:11.367
<i>He didn't show a single remorse.</i>

15:11.368 --> 15:14.538
<i>Nothing about him changed
as he continued eating.</i>

15:15.039 --> 15:18.751
<i>I frantically fired cleansing lights
one after another.</i>

15:19.251 --> 15:24.423
<i>I have gone beyond anger.
I was fearful of him.</i>

15:26.258 --> 15:27.675
<i>In the end,</i>

15:27.676 --> 15:30.595
<i>he died, without ever changing.</i>

15:30.596 --> 15:33.057
<i>Starvation was the cause of his death.</i>

15:36.560 --> 15:38.729
<i>He was innocent.</i>

15:39.229 --> 15:41.898
<i>He was simply hungry.</i>

15:41.899 --> 15:46.695
<i>That's why he sought food
and killed my family...</i>

15:46.946 --> 15:48.364
Ridiculous.

15:48.697 --> 15:51.950
<i>So, innocence will pardon any sins?</i>

15:51.951 --> 15:56.454
<i>- Is that what God decided? Then...</i>
- I'm sorry... I'm so sorry...

15:56.455 --> 16:02.502
<i>Then isn't true righteousness...
isn't the closest being to the saintly...</i>

16:02.503 --> 16:04.837
<i>...isn't it monsters?</i>

16:04.838 --> 16:06.590
Bishop Guitane...

16:07.091 --> 16:08.841
Boss...

16:08.842 --> 16:12.637
I'm sorry... I'm so sorry...

16:12.638 --> 16:13.846
Guitane...

16:13.847 --> 16:18.477
<i>After that, I vaguely recall
many people speaking to me...</i>

16:19.186 --> 16:24.650
<i>I replied to them in the most
sickeningly ordinary manner.</i>

16:25.401 --> 16:27.193
I am a priest.

16:27.194 --> 16:28.987
This is a sign.

16:28.988 --> 16:30.614
Believe in God.

16:33.075 --> 16:39.330
<i>But those feelings melted
into darkness and disappeared.</i>

16:39.331 --> 16:43.376
<i>The people celebrated me as a saint.</i>

16:43.377 --> 16:48.715
<i>Light couldn't dispel the darkness in me.</i>

16:48.716 --> 16:54.513
<i>That was when I realized
that this swirling abyss is not evil.</i>

16:55.305 --> 16:58.600
<i>God... So you will allow this?</i>

16:58.642 --> 17:01.395
<i>If this is not wrong...</i>

17:01.979 --> 17:05.899
<i>Then I will follow it
and unleash it upon the world.</i>

17:07.276 --> 17:10.738
<i>This pure white darkness.</i>

17:20.289 --> 17:23.541
After that, I seek out monsters who...

17:23.542 --> 17:24.542
Stop already.

17:24.543 --> 17:28.547
You just started talking on and on.
Look at my face now.

17:29.214 --> 17:32.885
So depressing, so long...
It's all black and white now somehow.

17:34.303 --> 17:37.681
I'm just a random seventh prince.
What do you want me to do?

17:38.223 --> 17:40.433
Yes, I understand.

17:40.434 --> 17:43.436
It must've been uncomfortable
to hear all that...

17:43.437 --> 17:46.190
For a "God" such as yourself.

17:48.442 --> 17:52.945
But that is exactly why
you have to hear it.

17:52.946 --> 17:56.075
You have a duty to hear
everything I've been through

17:56.450 --> 17:59.327
and to deal with my very self.

17:59.328 --> 18:03.206
Right, right.
I get it, so start already.

18:03.207 --> 18:04.916
So...

18:04.917 --> 18:09.213
Is God not willing to listen to words?!

18:09.797 --> 18:12.216
You're the last person
I want to hear that from!

18:13.884 --> 18:16.052
What a lovely voice...

18:16.053 --> 18:19.681
The songstress, Sister Escher
has brought about a miracle!

18:20.224 --> 18:24.228
We must hold on!
Sister Escher is singing for us!

18:25.145 --> 18:28.231
Babylon, where are we going?!

18:28.232 --> 18:32.193
And what's with this song?!
It's taking all the attention from me!

18:32.194 --> 18:35.321
It subdued the chaos of the townspeople!

18:35.322 --> 18:38.491
Not only that, but it also decapitated
the chimeras from the sky!

18:38.492 --> 18:41.787
This song must be God's answer!

18:42.371 --> 18:45.499
<i>Nah, I'm sure it was our boss
who took out the chimeras.</i>

18:46.083 --> 18:47.000
<i>But...</i>

18:48.418 --> 18:49.753
<i>Another noise in the song...</i>

18:50.295 --> 18:52.463
<i>Don't force yourself, Escher...</i>

18:52.464 --> 18:54.257
<i>Right now, this song...</i>

18:54.258 --> 18:57.010
<i>...is keeping the hearts
of the people strong.</i>

18:59.471 --> 19:01.514
<i>If we lose this song...</i>

19:01.515 --> 19:03.767
<i>We won't be able
to subdue the chaos again.</i>

19:06.937 --> 19:08.272
<i>That's why...</i>

19:12.943 --> 19:14.486
<i>We cannot stop.</i>

19:15.445 --> 19:17.156
<i>At the end of this song...</i>

19:19.116 --> 19:21.034
<i>In the far distance of this battle...</i>

19:22.035 --> 19:24.413
<i>Beyond this unceasing rainstorm...</i>

19:25.789 --> 19:27.207
<i>- A rainbow would rise!
- A rainbow would rise!</i>

19:28.834 --> 19:30.586
<i>- We believe so!
- We believe so!</i>

19:39.887 --> 19:42.931
Escher has a nice voice, don't you think?

19:43.599 --> 19:45.309
And big sister Saria as well.

19:45.893 --> 19:48.187
She's even better than when we practiced.

19:49.563 --> 19:54.317
You know, I really want you to hear this.

19:54.318 --> 19:55.694
What?!

19:57.029 --> 19:58.446
<i>What just happened?!</i>

19:58.447 --> 20:02.701
I'll fire this to the rhythm of the song.
Listen carefully.

20:11.501 --> 20:14.795
<i>What happened?!
New application of teleport spell?!</i>

20:14.796 --> 20:16.923
<i>No, that should have a delay!</i>

20:16.924 --> 20:19.634
<i>Stealth x Spell.</i>

20:19.635 --> 20:21.677
<i>Sprint x Spell.</i>

20:21.678 --> 20:26.432
<i>A spell that is physically impossible
to see, and a spell too fast to see.</i>

20:26.433 --> 20:28.435
<i>Simple but troublesome, isn't it?</i>

20:29.061 --> 20:30.687
Celero Cascadia.

20:31.355 --> 20:32.939
Krypta Incinis.

20:32.940 --> 20:34.316
(Fwoom)

20:38.278 --> 20:42.073
The waterball went so fast, it froze!
How interesting!

20:42.074 --> 20:46.202
<i>A hidden spell that's impossible
to detect until it hits!</i>

20:46.203 --> 20:48.830
<i>But it's pointless!</i>

20:49.206 --> 20:52.334
<i>Lend me your strength, Civil War!</i>

20:53.377 --> 20:55.170
<i>Spinal Reflexes!</i>

20:58.340 --> 21:01.093
<i>Good, now I can detect that and...</i>

21:02.010 --> 21:04.304
<i>Krypta Celero Lithis!</i>

21:05.347 --> 21:08.599
Oh, so you can use Spinal Threads as well?

21:08.600 --> 21:10.893
Now I really have to catch you alive.

21:10.894 --> 21:13.604
<i>I-I managed to detect that just in time!</i>

21:13.605 --> 21:15.731
<i>But he's using so many spells!</i>

21:15.732 --> 21:17.858
<i>I must focus harder!</i>

21:17.859 --> 21:20.570
<i>Focus!</i>

21:23.949 --> 21:25.367
<i>Shut up!</i>

21:26.910 --> 21:30.122
<i>Mana Focus: Seven Goddesses.</i>

21:31.456 --> 21:32.958
<i>What is this?</i>

21:33.500 --> 21:36.628
<i>It cut through the Spinal Threads
before it could sense them.</i>

21:37.629 --> 21:40.882
<i>A luxa with mana so dense,
it lost its shine.</i>

21:41.508 --> 21:46.179
As if someone like you
could grasp the abyss of sorcery.

21:46.847 --> 21:47.764
<i>My...</i>

21:48.932 --> 21:54.771
<i>My decades of planning are being
destroyed by this undescribable thing...</i>

21:55.355 --> 22:00.526
<i>How could this... devilish thing be...</i>

22:00.527 --> 22:03.280
Right, I remember one thing you said.

22:04.448 --> 22:07.284
Something about your heart
isn't vulnerable, was it?

22:07.826 --> 22:10.620
How about we test that?

22:14.374 --> 22:15.542
<i>God?!</i>

22:16.084 --> 22:17.044
Glow.

23:51.596 --> 23:54.431
<i>The seventh prince. Is he a God?</i>

23:54.432 --> 23:57.269
<i>Or is he an innocent devil?</i>

23:57.769 --> 23:59.937
<i>Next time, on episode 24:</i>

23:59.938 --> 24:01.772
<i>"In the Light."</i>

24:01.773 --> 24:04.901
<i>You will witness the depths of sorcery.</i>
